      ],
      "details": "If these data were only available in figures, we used the \u201cWebPlotDigitizer\u201d tool (Rohatgi, 2022) to extract numerical values from published graphs. When the graphs were box and whisker plots, the mean and the standard deviation were estimated by using the online calculator published by Shi et al. (2020), and methodologies published by Luo et al. (2018) and Wan et al. (2014)."
