    "DEV_3_TrainModels": {
      "code": "DEV",
      "category_name": "Model Development",
      "status": "BLOCKED",
      "prerequisites": ["INSP_5_FeatureReview"],
      "details": "Write `15_train_models.py`. Load `data/features.csv` and discharge target. Standardize features. Perform grid search 10-fold CV: Ridge regression (alpha: [0.1,1,10]); RandomForestRegressor (n_estimators: [100,200,500], max_depth: [None,10,20]). Save best models to `models/ridge.pkl` and `models/rf.pkl`, and CV results to `outputs/model_cv_results.json`."
