{"project":"Downscale_ERA5_CRB_1980-2023","workflow":{
  "DSGN_1":{
    "code":"DSGN",
    "category_name":"Methodological Design",
    "status":"READY",
    "prerequisites":[],
    "details":"Outline the downscaling workflow: target variables are ERA5 total_precipitation and 2m_temperature for 1980–2023 over the Columbia River Basin defined by a shapefile. Implement a prototype phase using January 1980 ERA5 data to test clipping, reprojection (to EPSG:3310), and Ordinary Kriging (spherical variogram) to a 1 km grid. After manual inspection, scale to full period using dask for chunked processing."
  },
  "INFRA_1":{
    "code":"INFRA",
    "category_name":"Infrastructure",
    "status":"READY",
    "prerequisites":["DSGN_1"],
    "details":"On Windows 11, install required Python packages via pip: cdsapi, xarray, rioxarray, dask, pykrige, geopandas, shapely, netCDF4, rasterio, matplotlib. Ensure .cdsapirc is configured with Copernicus API key."
  },
  "ACQ_Shapefile":{
    "code":"ACQ",
    "category_name":"Data Acquisition",
    "status":"BLOCKED",
    "prerequisites":["INFRA_1"],
    "details":"Instruct the user to provide a shapefile or GeoJSON defining the Columbia River Basin boundary for clipping.",
    "ui_instructions":{
      "type":"user_upload",
      "prompt":"Please upload the Columbia River Basin boundary shapefile (or GeoJSON) into the workspace."
    }
  },
  "ACQ_ERA5_Prototype":{
    "code":"ACQ",
    "category_name":"Data Acquisition",
    "status":"BLOCKED",
    "prerequisites":["ACQ_Shapefile"],
    "details":"Write a script named `01_acquire_era5_prototype.py`. Use `cdsapi` to download ERA5 single-level data for variables `total_precipitation` and `2m_temperature` for January 1980 over the bounding box of the uploaded shapefile. Save the file to `data/era5_prototype_1980-01.nc`."
  },
  "ENG_Prototype_Subset":{
    "code":"ENG",
    "category_name":"Data Engineering",
    "status":"BLOCKED",
    "prerequisites":["ACQ_ERA5_Prototype"],
    "details":"Write a script named `02_subset_prototype.py`. Load `data/era5_prototype_1980-01.nc` with xarray and rioxarray, clip to the provided shapefile geometry, reproject to EPSG:3310, and save to `data/era5_prototype_clipped.nc`."
  },
  "INSP_Prototype_Subset":{
    "code":"INSP",
    "category_name":"Manual Inspection",
    "status":"BLOCKED",
    "prerequisites":["ENG_Prototype_Subset"],
    "details":"Human inspects `data/era5_prototype_clipped.nc`. Verify time dimension, variable names, spatial extent, and CRS.",
    "ui_instructions":{
      "type":"human_review",
      "prompt":"Load `data/era5_prototype_clipped.nc` in Python or Panoply. Confirm it covers the correct region and contains `total_precipitation` and `2m_temperature` for January 1980."
    },
    "cyclic_routing":{
      "condition":"Is the prototype subset correct?",
      "if_true":["DEV_Prototype_Kriging"],
      "if_false":["ENG_Prototype_Subset"]
    }
  },
